WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.356 --> 00:00:04.520
[DOOR SLAMS]

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.420
You are such a chicken!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.950
I mean, if you are great, truly great, you can play anywhere.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.200
But instead you choose a club like West Ham

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.420
because it's big and shiny, and you

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.100
know that they'll win whether you're there or not.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.150
And you'll never have to wonder if you're still as good

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.550
as you tell everyone you are.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.840
But you and I know that you are not.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.510
You're overrated.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:31.305
You're overpaid.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.090
And you eat too much asparagus!

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.240
[FOOTSTEPS]

